<h2>Filing For A Place on the Ballot for Brazoria Central Appraisal District's Board of Directors?&nbsp; <a href="http://www.brazoriacountyclerktx.gov/departments/elections/candidate-information/-fsiteid-1#!/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Candidate Information</a></h2>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p><strong>Due to legislative changes, beginning January&nbsp;1, 2026, all persons presenting a document for filing (in person) into the real property records of Brazoria County, are required to provide a photo ID to the Clerk.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><em><b>Texas Local Government Code §191.010</b></em></p>
