" id="dropdownrootitem4"><a class="dropdownrootitem4" data-navid="4" tabindex="0">Search Records</a><div class="megamenu_container widthcontainer2col"><div class="inner_container"><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/search-records/criminal-civil-probate" aria-label="Criminal, Civil &amp; Probate" data-navid="147" target="_self">Criminal, Civil &amp; Probate</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/search-records/real-property-and-vital-records" aria-label="Real Property and Vital Records" data-navid="149" target="_self">Real Property and Vital Records</a></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="megamenu_first" id="dropdownrootitem5"><a class="dropdownrootitem5" data-navid="5" tabindex="0">I Want To...</a><div class="megamenu_container widthcontainer4col"><div class="inner_container"><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/i-want-to/apply-for" aria-label="Apply for..." data-navid="166" target="_self">Apply for...</a><ul class="megamenu_level1"><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/search-records/festival-permit-info-form" aria-label="Festival Permit" data-navid="131" target="_self">Festival Permit</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/departments/recording-department/marriage-license-copy" aria-label="Marriage License" data-navid="167" target="_self">Marriage License</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/i-want-to/assumed-name" aria-label="Assumed Name" data-navid="168" target="_self">Assumed Name</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/i-want-to/apply-for/occupational-drivers-license" aria-label="Occupational Drivers License" data-navid="188" target="_self">Occupational Drivers License</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/i-want-to/apply-for/request-pia" aria-label="Request PIA" data-navid="1199" target="_self">Request PIA</a></li></ul></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/i-want-to/register-file" aria-label="Register/File..." data-navid="175" target="_self">Register/File...</a><ul class="megamenu_level1"><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/i-want-to/marks-and-brands" aria-label="Marks and Brands" data-navid="177" target="_self">Marks and Brands</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/i-want-to/register-file/property-fraud-alert" aria-label="Property Fraud Alert" data-navid="176" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Property Fraud Alert</a></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/i-want-to/property-fraud-information" aria-label="Property Fraud Information" data-navid="1209" target="_self">Property Fraud Information</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/services/contact-information-143" aria-label="Contact US" data-navid="143" target="_self">Contact US</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/search-records/related-links" aria-label="Helpful Related Links" data-navid="130" target="_self">Helpful Related Links</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/i-want-to/view-today-s-criminal-court-docket" aria-label="View Today's Criminal Court Docket" data-navid="185" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Today's Criminal Court Docket</a></li></ul></div></div></li></ul><script>
